OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOccasional
OL,6,Fshowers are possible through the
OL,7,Fevening, although gradually fading.
OL,8,FWhile one or two could linger into the
OL,9,Fearly hours of Sunday, most places
OL,10,Fwill be dry after midnight. Winds also
OL,11,Feasing to become light and variable.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FFine and dry, with light winds
OL,14,Fand some patchy fair weather cloud
OL,15,Fdeveloping through the day. Becoming
OL,16,Fcloudier overnight, with a
OL,17,Fstrengthening breeze. Temperatures
OL,18,Fnear normal for October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
